五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":55,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":3,"end":17},{"id":"wendi-e-p106j-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-6eb68753e8e520d9914c","layer":"pei","quote":"卓遂迁大驾，西都长安。","attribution":"裴注·典论自叙","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":521,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2aa5d4559ce229d0d61c","start":138,"end":149},{"id":"wudi-e-o010a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c3c5890f31591fa3c33e","layer":"original","quote":"二月，卓闻兵起，乃徙天子都长安〖1〗。卓留屯洛阳，遂焚宫室。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":99,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30},{"id":"wudi-q-b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗初平元年：公元 190 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-93d66253e23c705b336d","start":0,"end":17},{"id":"wudi-q-o009","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-20c7e941eb42ee97df8c","layer":"original","quote":"初平元年春正月〖1〗，后将军袁术、冀州牧韩馥、﹝一﹞豫州刺史孔伷、﹝二﹞兖州刺史刘岱、﹝三﹞河内太守王匡、﹝四﹞勃海太守袁绍、陈留太守张邈、东郡太守桥瑁、﹝五﹞山阳太守袁遗、﹝六﹞济北相鲍信，﹝七﹞同时俱起兵〖2〗。众各数万，推绍为盟主。太祖行奋武将军〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-a78f628e455e65143cb3","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-0e49ffb78b24a1a2a924","layer":"original","quote":"初平元年，义兵起，董卓迁帝于长安","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16},{"id":"yuanzhang-q2-28696686617ba37f2d5b","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-0e49ffb78b24a1a2a924","layer":"original","quote":"初平元年，义兵起，董卓迁帝于长安。幽州牧刘虞叹曰：“贼臣作乱，朝廷播荡〖2〗！四海俄然〖3〗，莫有固志。身备宗室遗老，不得自同于众〖4〗。今欲奉使，展效臣节，安得不辱命之士乎？”众议咸曰：“田畴虽年少，多称其奇。”畴时年二十二矣。","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":115},{"id":"zhonghua-q-eaa498b77cc7c3c3a1cc","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-7f5b058236b9717cea61","layer":"original","quote":"董卓迁天子长安","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":149,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":44,"end":51}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
